@SpotifyCares What’s New menu. Autotune 💩. ☹️ https://t.co/0gesimhGJA

@SpotifyCares No ballad of Lupe Montosa. https://t.co/na6MTNJ6sI

@SpotifyCares iOS app finds it. https://t.co/tUrSph37E0

